## What this project is
A small invoicing toolkit (`sales_toolkit/`) for a Nairobi retailer.
Money is in Kenya Shillings (KES).

## Commands
- Run tests: `python -m pytest -q`
- Run the CLI: `python -m sales_toolkit invoice data/sample_sales.csv --discount 10`

